---
---
<section id="services" class="py-20 bg-white dark:bg-dark-bg">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">Our Expertise</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle reveal">
        We specialize in creating innovative AI solutions that bridge the gap between cutting-edge research and practical applications.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">AI for Scholars</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Developing state-of-the-art machine learning models tailored for academic research in biology, computer science, and beyond.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-secondary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 5a1 1 0 011-1h14a1 1 0 011 1v2a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V5zM4 13a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 011 1v6a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1v-6zM16 13a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v6a1 1 0 01-1 1h-2a1 1 0 01-1-1v-6z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">User-Friendly UI</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Creating intuitive interfaces that make complex AI tools accessible to researchers without programming backgrounds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M9.172 9.172L5.636 5.636m3.536 9.192l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-5 0a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Offline Processing</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Client-side AI processing that works without internet, ensuring data privacy and accessibility anywhere.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
